{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using resnet50 as the image encoder instead of imagenet_vit_l, while keeping RNA encoder, profile setting, and aggregation consistent. Validation accuracy (0.536) and F1 (0.516) are significantly lower than the prior multimodal baseline (config_007) using imagenet_vit_l (0.725), suggesting resnet50 may underperform in this context. The exact impact of image encoder choice versus other factors remains uncertain, as no comparative analysis of aggregation or fusion strategies was conducted."
}

